  'Jawa Timur': 'East Java',
  'Meningkatnya volume pemohon perizinan di Mal Pelayanan Publik (MPP) Lamongan yang membutuhkan kepastian alur verifikasi berkas antar-dinas teknis, integrasi sistem antrean loket, serta percepatan penandatanganan dokumen perizinan.': 'The rising volume of licensing applicants at Lamongan Public Service Mall (MPP) requires clearer cross-agency technical file verification, counter queue integration, and faster permit document signing.',
  'Implementasi terpadu Smarchlink® SIPPADU dan SIANTER (Sistem Antrean & Tracking Pemohon) yang dihubungkan langsung dengan layar panggil loket MPP dan notifikasi status via SMS/WhatsApp.': 'Integrated implementation of Smarchlink® SIPPADU and SIANTER (Applicant Queue & Tracking System), directly connected to MPP counter call screens and SMS/WhatsApp status notifications.',
  'Indikator evaluasi layanan MPP yang perlu diverifikasi bersama manajemen dan pihak terkait.': 'MPP service evaluation indicators that need verification with management and related parties.',
  'Penerbitan izin menggunakan Tanda Tangan Elektronik (TTE) resmi sesuai kesiapan instansi.': 'Permit issuance using official electronic signatures based on institutional readiness.',
  'Integrasi sistem perizinan dan antrean lokasi sangat membantu petugas kami dalam melayani warga secara lebih tertata, cepat, dan transparan.': 'The integration of licensing and on-site queue systems greatly helps our staff serve residents in a more organized, faster, and more transparent way.',
  'Tim Pengelola Layanan MPP': 'MPP Service Management Team',
  'Koordinator Layanan Terpadu': 'Integrated Service Coordinator',
  'Instansi Pemerintah Daerah': 'Local Government Institution',
  'Penumpukan puluhan ribu berkas fisik arsip aktif dan inaktif di ruang penyimpan Sekretariat yang menyebabkan kesulitan penelusuran dokumen keputusan dan surat dinas masa lalu.': 'Tens of thousands of active and inactive physical archive files accumulated in the Secretariat storage room, making it difficult to trace past decision documents and official letters.',
  'Penerapan Smarchlink® Archive (E-Archive) disertai proyek pendampingan alih media (digitalisasi) dan penyusunan struktur klasifikasi arsip sesuai pedoman ANRI.': 'Implementation of Smarchlink® Archive (E-Archive) together with media conversion assistance and archive classification structure preparation based on ANRI guidance.',
  'Indikator waktu pencarian arsip digital yang perlu diverifikasi melalui data implementasi resmi.': 'Digital archive search-time indicators that need verification through official implementation data.',
  'Perusahaan Daerah BUMD': 'Regional Enterprise',
  'Risiko kehilangan dokumen fisik kontrak kerja sama dan sertifikat aset akibat lokasi penyimpanan yang tersebar di beberapa kantor cabang.': 'Risk of losing physical cooperation-contract documents and asset certificates because storage locations are spread across several branch offices.',
  'Sentralisasi penyimpanan arsip digital dengan Smarchlink Archive berbasis Cloud Private dan proteksi hak akses Role-Based.': 'Centralized digital archive storage using private-cloud-based Smarchlink Archive and role-based access protection.',
  'Indikator cakupan dokumen yang perlu diverifikasi berdasarkan berita acara implementasi resmi.': 'Document coverage indicators that need verification based on official implementation handover records.',
